Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.94,0:00:18.12,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&38918F&\blur3\fad(100,100)}世間蠻不講理
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.12,0:00:21.31,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&38918F&\blur3\fad(100,100)}一投一擲盡受掌控
