Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.53,0:00:58.25,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&EB9277&\blur3\fad(100,100)}沉迷其中無視外界
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.25,0:01:02.99,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&EB9277&\blur3\fad(100,100)}世界如此不公 那便將其顛覆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.99,0:01:04.87,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&6464EB&\blur3\fad(100,100)}循環無休無止
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.87,0:01:06.32,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&6464EB&\blur3\fad(100,100)}勝率一半一半
